n definitely think of two other women  who may have helped the girls launch  their careers there is of course their  mother Melissa Casone  who constantly fought to make sure her  girls were on Abby's dance radar I just  want you to and Abby herself who  arguably played the largest hand in  Maddie's rise to fame throughout the  season she began to proudly prioritize  Maddie over her teammates and use her in  order to encourage  the girls to be more hard-working and  competitive this was done through a ton  of small but significant gestures on  Abby's part for starters maddie was  given a ton of extra class time that the  other girls were not she was also given  more solos than many of her other  teammates and found herself at the top  of the dance pyramid even when the other  girls felt they had deserved it more  what many people don't know about Dance  Moms is that despite Abby's constant  appearance on the show in real life the  girls rarely got to see her that is  unless it was time for their dance  competitions fine the scenes however  Abby is said to have spent a ton of time  with Maddie's mother Melissa it didn't  take long before the other Dance Moms  noticed the exceptional treatment that  the Ziegler girls were getting from  their dance teacher and so the Maddie  issue began  despite Maddie being extremely talented  and hardworking all in her own the other  Dance Moms resented that their children  weren't receiving the same love and  praise from their dance teacher they  insisted that it just wasn't fair since  they all pay the same tuition that  Maddie does to be there and that Maddie  was still the one being praised even  when another girl was the winning  soloist of the night Chloe recap it  didn't take long before  Abby's favoritism became too much for  Maddie's best friend at the time Chloe  Lucchesi at Chloe and her mother Christi  were constantly being compared to Maddie  and Melissa it's always all about her  daughter and no one else Abby even went 