e Rockefeller tree lighting  and even joining Mariah Carey on her  diva tour this little dancer even got to  play a role in the ballet scene of the  greatest showmen alongside stars like  Zac Efron and zendaya  while this new group of dancers is  definitely different than the original  Dance Moms girls we can still spot a few  similarities between the two groups that  might tell us just how this new story is  going to go after watching a sneak peek  of the newest season we can already spot  a lot of Chloe Lucas he acts kind and  sweet characteristics in dancer Hanna  Collins in a Dance Moms season eight  preview and I can be seen talking about  Abby's teaching style in a very  appreciative way and mentions how she  hopes to build lifelong friendships  they're all amazing dancers with the  rest of her teammates with Lily being  one of the younger dancers of the group  her goofiness reminds us of McKenzie  back when she started her Dance Moms  journey another dancer who stands out to  us is Cameron after some Instagram  digging we can already tell that Cameron  has a lot of that fiery personality we  can relate to one of our favorite  dancers Jojo CY while Cameron is a lot  younger than Jojo was when she first  made an appearance on the show we just  can't help but feel her confidence and  energy radiating through her dancing  before we get to our big question of who  the next Maddy will be we thought we  would also mention another dancer who is  constantly compared to Maddie throughout  her own time on Dance Moms  Brynn rum fellow for those of you who  need a quick recap on Brynn her and her  mother Ashley first made their  appearance on Dance Moms back in its  fifth season she first made her way onto  the team as a guest dancer from the club  dance along with her former teammate  Sarah reasons this is actually the same  studio that Kalani was a part of as well  now Sarah may have only been brought on  momentarily to help push Nia's  boundaries but it seems like Abby