ms cast  making it pretty much impossible for  this young dancer not to stand out  despite being a total sweetheart with  his teammates this dancer is ultra  competitive when he's on stage and even  as fans comparing his dance style to  Maddie's now we all know that Abby  prioritizes dance skills above pretty  much everything else a dancer has to  offer  aside from star quality that is it isn't  hard to see that Abby's previous dancers  didn't lack a shred of talent but even  then only a handful of dancers had what  it took to catch Abby's attention  Abby clearly sees that very same star  power in Brady since he admits that  there have already been clashes between  the moms simply because Abby gives him  extra praise Abby can even be spotted  asking one of the mothers got jealous of  a 14 year old boy just like Maddie  though Brady maintains his relationship  with his teammates and seems to be very  close with all of them he mentions that  no matter what happens between their  moms they'll always be best friends  Brady seems to already be on his way to  a Maddie Ziegler level of Fame having  already danced on The Ellen Show as well  as Dancing with the Stars in our books  there really is nobody who can replace  Maddie Ziegler or any of the original  girls that this cast will undoubtedly  give them a run for their money  reddit user big brother zoom has posted  some of his season 8 predictions online  he thinks he has an idea of what the  next Dance Moms will be like he guesses  that Stacy Lily's mom will do whatever  she has to do to get Lily on top of the  pyramid just like Melissa  Yolanda on the other hand might feel  threatened by Lily's success and feud  with Stacy similarly to Christi Lukasiak  whatever the case we just hope that the  team will be able to put all of that  past drama behind them and focus on  supporting each other with Abby's track  record they're definitely going to need  all of the support and encouragement  they can get we will definitely be  tuning in to watch season 8 of Dance  Moms we can't wait to see what Abby and  the team accomplished if you're excited  to watch the upcoming  leave your favorite emoji in the comment  section who do you think the next Maddie  will be let us know in the comment  section below and that's a wrap be sure  to subscribe to the things and don't  forget to give this video a big thumbs  up thanks for watching see you guys next  time  [Music]

